{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-isola-bella","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"isola-bella-mak-developers-jumeirah-village-circle","about":"I'sola Bella is a 21-storey complex from the developer MAK Developers, where you can enjoy a combination of luxury amenities with the vibrant energy of urban life.The complex includes 204 apartments with 1-2 bedrooms and studios. This magnificent structure combines innovative design and timeless elegance. Inspired by the beautiful island of I'sola Bella in Italy, the complex now adorns the city, bringing a touch of European sophistication to its heart.More than 45 amenities are available to residents. Among them you will find a gym, a yoga room, a communal swimming pool, a children's playground, a Jacuzzi, a SPA and sauna, an indoor and outdoor cinema, a barbecue area and many relaxation areas, as well as animal walking areas. The complex is also equipped with a private beach pool.The superb location provides unprecedented accessibility to all sought-after destinations.","price":617948,"title":"I’Sola Bella","bitrix":{"id":980,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"I’Sola Bella","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"I’Sola Bella","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"MAK Developers","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/I_Sola_Bella_by_MAK_Developers_in_Jumeirah_Village_Circle_JVC_for_Sale_e71bdb2269.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/I_Sola_Bella_by_MAK_Developers_in_Jumeirah_Village_Circle_JVC_for_Sale_e71bdb2269.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0516987,"lng":55.1997136},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2862/images/i/340x252/I_Sola_Bella_by_MAK_Developers_in_Jumeirah_Village_Circle_JVC_for_Sale_e71bdb2269.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.